  1+  9000              ; =========================================================================
  2+  9000              ; PROJECT127 ATM native video service v0.3.0
  3+  9000              ; Confirmed ATM Turbo 2+ RG6 80x25 text framebuffer.
  4+  9000              ; Host code occupies page 5, so video uses the established alternate
  5+  9000              ; framebuffer pages 7 (characters) and 3 (attributes).
  6+  9000              ;
  7+  9000              ; API:
  8+  9000              ;   P127_ATM_Video_Query: A=mode, B=columns, C=rows, HL=frame bytes
  9+  9000              ;   P127_ATM_Video_WriteCell: D=row, E=column, A=character; attr defaults #44
 10+  9000              ;   P127_ATM_Video_WriteCellEx: D=row, E=column, A=character, B=attribute
 11+  9000              ;   P127_ATM_Video_ReadCell: D=row, E=column; returns A=character, B=attribute
